n godot.\n3. Observe log errors complaining about translations not matching locale (normal, not a translation file)\n4. Find the file in the Godot file explorer, double click it\n5. Observe log errors \n```\n  ERROR: Resource file not found:  (expected type: Translation)\n  ERROR: Failed loading resource: res://bug.csv.\n  ERROR: editor/editor_node.cpp:1536 - Condition \"res.is_null()\" is true. Returning: ERR_CANT_OPEN\n```\n6. Observe that inspector does not change to show the file information\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[csv-bug-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22562354/csv-bug-project.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110931/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110931/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}